WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.730
Kotetsu!

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.880
Hurry! You must remember quickly!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.620
Even with blood armaments, he's still so weak.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.530
He's only just awakened.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.030
Finish him!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.040
Sorry, Chihiro-san.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.420
I don't want to lose anyone.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.770
Not ever again!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.250
What?

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.800
Ch-Chihiro-san?

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.210
Are you okay, Kotetsu?

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:51.900
Chihiro-san!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.000
Who to an Old Conflict?

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:31.500
My leg's numb.

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:34.710
Diabolos have poisonous spears.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.770
Poison? What should I do?

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.830
Call my name.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:39.990
Your name?

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.100
Hurry!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.390
Morizono Eiko!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.890
No, my <i>real</i> name!

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.350
Remember!

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.000
You should know who I am now!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.740
Cerdid...

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:00.860
Yes!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.540
Who are you?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.290
Let me handle Kotetsu.

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:15.310
So he has a Defender.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:20.230
Your beloved is a tough one.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.550
Don't.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.050
Chihiro-san.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.980
Are you okay, Kotetsu?

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:34.620
Yeah.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:46.770
Damn.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.510
Impressive.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:51.260
You killed it with a single blow.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.280
Don't.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.080
Huh?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:57.590
He was a university student
here, just like me.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:03:59.400
And now...

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.300
You couldn't have done anything.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.360
That again?!

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.300
Stop using that excuse!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.820
I understand how you feel.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:12.220
But once someone becomes
a familiar, there's no going back.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.310
You have to kill them.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.920
Still, I don't want to...

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.360
Kakihara-san?

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.810
I had no idea such monsters existed.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:27.570
It's hard to believe, but a journalist
believes what he sees is the truth.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.560
This is a huge scoop.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.450
Now it all makes sense.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:36.130
You killed the missing Domyoji
Rakan the same way, didn't you?

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.090
I just—

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.550
Well, murder is your forte.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:44.170
Stop!

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.950
It's not Chihiro-san's fault!

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.880
Your father was murdered.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:51.690
You should know he—

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.810
Again.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.260
I can summon it again and again

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.570
as long as I have humans to open gates.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.610
You did it again!

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.900
Death to the Heroic Lineage.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.250
I'll do whatever it takes.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.670
Chihiro-san!

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.080
Chihiro!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.130
His blood armaments protected him.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.430
It's been empowered.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:29.800
No way...

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.190
I'll take you on!

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:36.020
You just had the poison removed. You can't.

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:37.520
Kill him.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.090
What's wrong?

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:50.890
Hang in there, Tsubasa!

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:51.950
My head...

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.580
Could it be?

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:07.490
He's lost control.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.790
Hurry up and kill him!

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.350
It's amazing, but...

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:16.020
He mustn't.

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:19.360
His body won't last if he uses
his power that way.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.400
Chihiro-san...

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.400
What is this?

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:31.680
Kakihara-san...

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.160
Damn! Why is this happening to Tsubasa?

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.380
Not even an empowered Diabolos can kill him.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:41.630
Just how much power is hiding in that Vessel?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:47.510
Damn!

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.230
What should I do?

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.520
You should awaken, too.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.980
Who are you?

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:58.520
The Heroic Blood inside you
is the only way to save her.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.730
I'll do anything!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.520
I'll do anything, just save her!

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.380
Save Tsubasa!

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.730
Call her name.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.580
The name engraved in the
memory of your heroic blood.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.700
Her true name.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.200
Aero...

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.130
T-Tsubasa?

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.130
It's Aero.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.590
Kakihara, too?

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.640
A Vessel of Heroic Lineage.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.350
A third?

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.890
Heroic Blood calls Heroic Blood.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.150
I misjudged this situation.

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:55.620
Then I'll at least kill Kamina Chihiro.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.070
This ends here.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.430
Yeah. We have no choice.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:34.030
We'll return and make our report.

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.450
Be careful.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:43.610
If you fight like that,
you'll die of blood loss.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:54.930
Who are you?

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.610
My name is Hanashima Shoko.

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:00.930
I'm delighted to meet
a Vessel of Heroic Lineage.

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:02.510
Are you all right?

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:07.310
You're the Lord of Creation's...

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.360
Be strong.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.010
What happened to me?

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.830
You lost control.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.880
Lost control?

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:21.100
It's your fault for behaving recklessly when
you don't even know how to use your power.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.760
It's especially serious in your case,
since your power's so great.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.000
Kamina Chihiro!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.030
Turn Tsubasa back to normal!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.700
This is your fault, isn't it?

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.920
Hey, stop that!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.920
What did you do to Tsubasa?!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:33.720
What?

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.630
It's impossible, Kakihara-san.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.920
What?

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:41.880
Now that she's a familiar, she
can never be made human again.

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:42.760
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.440
Give Tsubasa back!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.690
As I've said, it's impossible.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:46.550
Chihiro-san!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.510
Iku-san is...

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.620
Ikuro.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:55.030
He couldn't become a familiar.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.850
You're lucky.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.230
This is nearly what happened to Tsubasa-san.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:01.510
How is this lucky?!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.780
That's enough!

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.840
Please! Save Iku-san!

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.110
I'll take him.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.590
What are you doing here?

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.630
He's one of us.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.690
One of you?

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.510
You must be confused.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.920
Come with me.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:20.910
Where?

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.170
Maldeus Church.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:31.270
Welcome to Maldeus Church.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:35.700
It is the sacred stronghold of the Heroic
Lineage who fight against Chaos.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.530
Chaos?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:42.240
As their name suggests, they are the forces
that seek to plunge the world into chaos.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.810
Our enemies.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.660
I don't get it.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.440
More importantly, where's Tsubasa?

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:52.860
Aero-san is being examined at the hospital.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:55.670
Cerdid-san is with her, so don't worry.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.170
Aero, huh?

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:03.050
Hanashima-san, tell us exactly what's going on.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.060
Our leader will tell you.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.470
Leader?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.560
"We are such stuff as dreams are made on."

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:16.790
Huh?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:20.880
"Yea, all which it inherit, shall dissolve,
like this insubstantial pageant faded."

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.100
When did she get there?

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.900
No way... She's...

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:32.160
Welcome, Vessels of Heroic Blood.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.960
I am Dux.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:36.460
Dux...

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.530
Chihiro-san, you know her?

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.080
I met her once in a dream.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:40.980
A dream?

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:45.010
Dreams are a mirror through
which we peer into other worlds.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.970
We meet again, Kamina Chihiro.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.280
Impossible.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.780
I tagged along for some answers,

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:57.860
and now some chick wearing
a weird mask appears.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.360
How rude.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.750
All I need to tell the truth is this mouth.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.870
Am I wrong?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.600
Well said.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:10.630
Judging someone by appearances
makes me a failure of a journalist.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.480
No smoking inside the church.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:17.380
Tell us. Why is this happening to us?

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:19.540
Everything is destiny.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.060
That's not an answer.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.470
It begins with the future.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:29.890
40 years from now,
this world will be destroyed.

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.110
What?

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.960
Eschatology, huh?

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.140
This is stupid.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.370
I'm simply telling you the truth.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:42.530
Which means those monsters are
invaders, and we have to stop them.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.250
You cannot stop them.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:48.110
Destruction will arrive,
and a new world will begin.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.410
Huh? What kind of future is that?

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:55.600
The birth of a new world always
occurs after destruction.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.320
And what does that have to do with us?

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:02.700
The new world will be born
from either hope or chaos,

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.680
and the key to that is in the hands
of the Vessels of Heroic Blood.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:07.790
You.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:09.980
Us?

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.430
What are Vessels of Heroic Blood?

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:18.220
When destruction arrives, a hero named
the Lord of Vermilion will appear

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:20.930
and build a new world overflowing with hope.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.590
The Vessels of Heroic Blood
are those with the capacity

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:26.410
to become the Lord of Vermilion.

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.570
Lord of Vermilion...

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:33.570
If the Lord of Vermilion is not born,
the world will be ruled by Chaos.

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:36.730
War, poverty, sickness...

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:40.840
A chain of terrible events will begin,
and humanity will sink into despair.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:45.940
Not even tabloids would buy that fairy tale.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:48.610
I thought what you saw with
your eyes was the truth.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:50.920
Were humans becoming monsters

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:54.190
and your dear assistant transforming
all a fairy tale as well?

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.730
Who are the ones who transformed my dad?

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:01.940
Agents of Chaos.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.240
Three Vessels of Heroic Blood have awakened,

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:13.740
and all three of them have aligned
themselves with Maldeus Church?

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.500
I believe so.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:19.070
They're trying to destroy the world

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:22.170
to create their personal paradise.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:24.500
Isn't that right, Van Drayle?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:28.840
They claim destruction will arrive in 40 years,

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.510
but it's no big deal.

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.640
They're going to destroy it.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:38.640
But they also claim a world
full of hope will come.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:39.980
It's sophistry.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:44.270
Even if a utopia will be born,
this world will be destroyed.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.470
If the foundation of this new world—
the Heroic Lineage—is eliminated,

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:49.150
then we can escape destruction.

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.500
We must save our world.

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:55.410
And to do that, we have our science.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.670
Death to the Heroic Lineage!

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:00.920
They caused the Great Collapse?

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.010
Yes.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.390
Because of the Great Collapse,

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:07.670
creatures from other worlds
are able to enter this one.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.390
By using living humans as gates.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:12.680
Unbelievable.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:16.490
Tokyo is now a hunting ground
filled with monsters created

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.630
to trap and kill the Heroic Lineage.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.980
What should we do?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.640
Survive. That is everything.

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:26.690
Against those monsters?

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:28.940
There is a way.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:29.890
What?

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.410
Destroy Tokyo.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:38.990
Once Tokyo is gone, they won't
be able to open any gates.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:43.210
Destroy this city to save your future.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.340
Chihiro.

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.590
Tsubasa?

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.440
Great! You're back to normal.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:54.640
Tsubasa?

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.840
I'm Aero.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.080
Only her appearance has been restored.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.710
Like me, she's not actually Tsubasa-san.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.060
What do you mean?

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.630
We are Defenders of the Heroic Lineage.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.320
We arrived during the Great Collapse.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.960
The Great Collapse?

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:13.760
Then when you appeared
before us, you were already...

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.230
Cerdid.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:17.560
I was simply pretending to be Morizono Eiko.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.830
Then where's the real Morizono-san?

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.290
Don't lie to me!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.900
Even after the Great Collapse,
Tsubasa was the same!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.170
Some were awakened from the beginning like me.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:33.860
Others were asleep and unaware, like her.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:37.800
She was finally awakened by
the waves created by Chihiro-san.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:40.350
Waves?

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:42.350
So it <i>is </i>your fault!

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.210
How many people do you have
to kill before you're satisfied?!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:46.350
If not for you...

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:47.590
Turn her back!

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:49.450
Turn Tsubasa back to her former self!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.000
Shut up!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:54.520
Anyone yelling in the hospital
is getting their ass thrown out!

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.980
Sorry, but it's impossible. I'm—

00:16:57.980 --> 00:17:00.010
What happened to the real Tsubasa?

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.500
All I can say for now is "nowhere."

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:05.330
Is she dead?

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:09.840
Not even we know what happens
to those we switch places with.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:19.840
You're going to leave me too, Tsubasa?

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:23.240
You always asked

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:27.900
if it was necessary to
stubbornly pursue Kamina.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.730
And I ignored you.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.830
Is this my fault?

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:39.750
Did this happen to you because
I wouldn't stop following him?

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.550
No. It's all <i>his</i> fault!

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:44.940
Kamina Chihiro's fault!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.430
I will avenge you.

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:51.560
Until everything becomes clear,
I'll hold on, even if it kills me.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.450
Ikuro...

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.300
He shouldn't change any further, for now.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.750
Iku-san.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.720
I've been secretly taking
in people like Ikuro-san

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:06.180
who have become partially merged
with creatures of other worlds.

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:07.940
Can he be cured?

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.230
It's not that easy.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.220
Cerdid, you guys must know something.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.820
Don't be ridiculous.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.030
We were simply summoned from beyond.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.330
By the Great Collapse?

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.200
Yes.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:28.150
Humans have an unidentified
gene known as the Arcana gene.

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:29.710
Arcana gene?

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:34.740
"What is the soul?" It's the
eternal scientific question.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:38.250
Apparently this gene is related
to some spiritual quality.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:40.470
The same Arcana gene exists in you all,

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:44.370
as well as the creatures from
other dimensions and worlds,

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.600
and they resonate with one another.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.250
When that resonance strengthens,

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.910
creatures from other worlds
cross into our dimension.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:55.470
They use humans with strong connections
to their Arcana genes, turn them into gates,

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.970
and enter this world.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:00.580
And that was suddenly brought about...

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.000
...by the Great Collapse.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:06.920
Though some can coexist with their
human forms like Cerdid and Aero,

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:12.000
those who can't withstand being used
as gates seem to vanish into a red mist.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.790
Iku-san won't turn into the red mist, will he?

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.190
I'll keep treating him.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.510
Can he be cured?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.500
You just don't get it.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.510
We're working on it right now!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.470
Ikuro.

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:25.470
Is this my fault?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:29.740
Because of your involvement with me, even you...

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.560
And if that's true?

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:40.600
The stench of death that clings
to you pulls in those around you.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:46.170
Ikuro!

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:48.320
Such a tragedy.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:52.210
Everything disappears, and all
that ever remains is you.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:53.600
Dux!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:55.800
It's all your fault.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:59.760
No. I didn't do anything.

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.700
Then what is that in your hand?

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:11.700
It was the same back then.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.870
Please stop. I...

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:19.820
Yes. That hand has been
stained with blood since then.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:21.890
Forgive me.

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:24.780
Do you seek salvation?

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:30.300
Even inevitable tragedies
sometimes receive applause.

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:33.980
Yes, so long as the tragedy
you invite has meaning.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:34.790
What?

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:39.240
Even if your hands are stained with
blood and everything is destroyed,

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:41.970
as long as hope lies beyond it,

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.510
the blood you spill will
be the foundation of the future.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.810
You can't escape your fate.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.890
However, if you insist
on seeking forgiveness...

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.170
You must choose.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.400
Dux! Dux!

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:02.590
Is something wrong?

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:03.800
Where's Dux?

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:04.830
Huh?

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:07.870
Chihiro-san, your hand...

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.870
Oh, come on! Don't hurt yourself in a hospital!

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:16.200
Huh? There's no wound.

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:19.380
This is old, isn't it?

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.180
Don't!

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:22.320
What's your problem?

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.970
S-Sorry.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.270
I don't get you.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.850
So long as it has meaning, huh?
